{
  "id": "unique-event-013",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#13 - The Clown’s Mask\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,385,408]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The clown is wearing a rubber\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,408,438]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mask. He is not anyone you know.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,438,471]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you unmask him, you realize\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,471,502]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that the mask is alive. Its mind is in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,502,541]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your head, and is trying to force\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,541,575]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you to wear the mask. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,575,605]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "throw away the mask and return\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,605,636]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to your activities, or put it on by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,636,672]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-013:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "going to #15.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[83,672,686]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    83
  ]
}
